OL,3,GNEWSAWarning as caravan filled with
OL,4,Arubbish dumped by A52
OL,5,
OL,6,FEnvironmental health officers have
OL,7,Fappealed for help to track down the
OL,8,Fowner of a caravan filled with waste
OL,9,Fafter it was dumped in a lay-by.
OL,11,FThe vehicle - which was cordoned off by
OL,12,Fcouncil workers - is thought to have
OL,13,Fbeen left at the side of the A52 in
OL,14,FNottinghamshire on or before Monday.
OL,16,FRushcliffe Borough Council said the
OL,17,Fcaravan, which has the model name
OL,18,FTornado, had brought a "whirlwind of
OL,19,Fwaste" to the roadside between
OL,20,FRadcliffe-on-Trent and the Saxondale
OL,21,Fjunction with the A46.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
